Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.58,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.65,0:00:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿派大星  有了这个时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, with this time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:06.62,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(502,97.778)}时空旅行
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就能回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we can go back to the past
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.45,0:00:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让小时候的我们变得更聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and make our young selves wiser
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.96,0:00:08.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很难想象那是什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:08.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's difficult to imagine
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我很想看我们试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to see us try
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:11.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(386,325.333)}启动
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.60,0:00:18.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,教育要从娃娃抓起  小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's never too early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to start your education, young man
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才给你带了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I brought you this
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up, little fella
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好为他骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of him
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.91,0:00:27.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到你了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:27.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, your turn, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就免了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm good
